# Vaultwarden/Bitwarden render map for Graphiti production env.
# Format consumed by scripts/secrets/run-with-vaultwarden-env.sh and render-env-from-vaultwarden.sh:
#   ENV_NAME|folder|item|field
#
# Values live in Vaultwarden and must never be committed after rendering.
# Folder name is case-sensitive; operator audit on 2026-10-01 observed `Homelab`.
# If OPENROUTER_API_KEY is later normalized to custom field `api_key`, change the
# final column from `password` to `api_key` before rendering.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY|Homelab|graphiti/openrouter|password
NEO4J_USER|Homelab|graphiti/neo4j|username
NEO4J_PASSWORD|Homelab|graphiti/neo4j|password
